cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Selective-CDSS: Risk-Controlled Selective Prediction for Clinical Decision Services"
abstract: >-
  An abstention layer that wraps any probabilistic clinical classifier and holds
  the false-negative rate of the decisions it keeps below a chosen ceiling, even
  under degraded input data. The repository contains the reference
  implementation, a deterministic seed-42 driver that regenerates every reported
  metric to committed CSVs, and the figure generators.
